--- ISSUE 2/5 ---
id: PER-003
severity: moderate
category: a11y-perceivable
found_by: static
title: Inline SVGs are labelled or hidden from assistive tech
problem: 3 inline <svg> with no aria-label, role=img, or aria-hidden — meaningful icons go unnamed and decorative ones add screen-reader noise.
why_it_matters: A meaningful inline SVG needs an accessible name; a decorative one needs aria-hidden. Neither default is safe to assume.
standards: wcag:1.1.1, aria:img
locations:
  - apps/ui-remix/src/ui/ThemeToggle.tsx:60:5 ~dd43
