     126|       <p class="lede">A 561-point walkthrough of the <b>factstack</b> codebase written for a brand-new CTO with no prior context. Every point is one plain-English idea. Strengths, plain facts, risks, and recommendations are colour-coded so  …[+41 chars]
     127|       <div class="meta">branch: apps-remix3 · self-analysis: 470 files · 1,548 symbols · 99 whole-stack entities · 0 risks · 0 vulns · schema 0.1.0</div>
     128|       <div class="gates">
fix: Keep a single <h1> and structure the rest with <h2>–<h6> in order.

