--- ISSUE 5/5 ---
id: ROB-017
severity: info
category: a11y-robust
found_by: static
title: Redundant ARIA roles are not added to native elements
problem: 1 native element(s) carry a redundant role (e.g. <button role="button">) — harmless but noisy and a maintenance trap.
why_it_matters: Applying role=button to <button> or role=link to <a> is harmless but creates maintenance confusion and review noise.
standards: aria:aria-in-html
locations:
  - apps/ui-remix/src/ui/MarginColumn.tsx:64:5 ~01e7
      61|   return () => {
      62|     const { children, align = 'top' } = handle.props;
      63|     return (
      64|     <aside <<<
      65|       role="complementary"
      66|       mix={css({
      67|         gridColumn: '2',
fix: Remove roles that restate an element's implicit role.


