by category: consistency 24 · performance 23 · responsive 22 · visual-hierarchy 22 · forms 21 · i18n 20 · states 20 · a11y-operable 19 · a11y-understandable 19 · navigation 19 · spacing-layout 19 · ux-copy 19 · feedback 18 · motion 18 · semantics 18 · typography 18 · color-contrast 17 · trust-privacy 17 · a11y-perceivable 16 · a11y-robust 10
