- [critical] CLR-003 Normal-size body text meets 4.5:1 contrast ratio
- [critical] I18N-002 Translated strings are never built by concatenation
- [critical] MOT-006 Content must not flash more than three times per second
- [critical] OPR-005 Keyboard focus never becomes trapped in a component
- [critical] OPR-018 Content does not flash more than three times per second
- [critical] TRU-014 Secrets and PII are never placed in URLs
- [serious] CLR-004 Large text meets 3:1 contrast ratio
- [serious] CLR-005 UI components and graphical objects meet 3:1 contrast
